{"id":"1286ea476a66f084","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-pr-function-closed.md","title":"PR Function Closure Properties","display":"df-pr-function-closed — PR Function Closure Properties","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-pr-function-closed","aliases":["92-df-pr-function-closed"],"display":"df-pr-function-closed — PR Function Closure Properties","depends_on":["[[92-df-pr-function]]","[[92-df-composition]]","[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]"],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-pr-function-closed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-pr-function-closed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pr-function-closed — PR Function Closure Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive recursive functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NF}\">\\(\\mathsf{NF}\\)</span> (total number-theoretic function universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"736154be0fae643a\" href=\"?note=736154be0fae643a\" title=\"92-df-pr-function\">92-df-pr-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}\\)</span> (composition operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7d55d92fc12a07fc\" href=\"?note=7d55d92fc12a07fc\" title=\"92-df-composition\">92-df-composition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> (primitive-recursion operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cc110e19a2eae4ea\" href=\"?note=cc110e19a2eae4ea\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator\">92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRClosed}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRClosed}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}function\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRClosed}(C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;C\\subseteq\\mathsf{NF}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in(C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k})^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathrm{PR}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}function\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRClosed}(C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;C\\subseteq\\mathsf{NF}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in(C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k})^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathrm{PR}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PR函数类的封闭性</li>\n<li>封闭于复合：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f \\circ g \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(f \\circ g \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n<li>封闭于原始递归：递归定义保持PR</li>\n<li>PR 对适当形式的有界搜索/受限极小化也封闭，但这是由这里两种基本闭包运算导出的另一个定理，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRClosed}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRClosed}\\)</span> 谓词的额外定义条款</li>\n<li>不封闭于无界极小化</li>\n<li>PR函数是递归函数的子集</li>\n<li>封闭性保证PR函数可累加构建</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive recursive functions, see [[92-df-pr-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-function","status":"resolved","id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NF}$ (total number-theoretic function universe, see [[92-df-pr-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7d55d92fc12a07fc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}$ (composition operator, see [[92-df-composition]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k$ (primitive-recursion operator, see [[92-df-primitive-recursion-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRClosed}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr\\text{-}function\\text{-}closed} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PRClosed}(C)\\leftrightarrow{}&C\\subseteq\\mathsf{NF}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\,\n\\forall(h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in(C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k})^m\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Comp}_{k,m}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)\\in C\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\forall g\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\,\n\\forall h\\in C\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\in C\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{PRClosed}(\\mathrm{PR}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f \\circ g \\in \\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRClosed}","display":false}],"bytes":2060,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-function-closed]]"}],"outgoing":["736154be0fae643a","7d55d92fc12a07fc","cc110e19a2eae4ea"]}